# Remember to never publicly share your keystore.
# See https://flutter.dev/to/reference-keystore
key.properties
**/*.keystore
**/*.jks
# Exception: app/keystore/debug.keystore IS committed on purpose - a debug key secures nothing,
# and CI needs a stable one so every build shares one signature (see build.gradle.kts).
!app/keystore/debug.keystore
